{"pages":[{"segs":[["SC R I P T U R E M E M O RY 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,600.59989999999993,9,false],["SCRIPTURE",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,354.46000000000004,116.00059999999996,80,false],["MEMORY",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,315.34000000000003,176.00059999999996,80,false],["RENEWING THE MIND",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,350.48000000000002,194.10059999999999,20,false],["“A woman must not wear men’s clothing, nor a man",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999997,335.63400000000001,237.84589999999992,9,false],["wear women’s clothing, for the LORD your God detests",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,346.58699999999999,250.8418999999999,9,false],["anyone who does this” (Deuteronomy 22:5).",146.40000000000001,251.42689999999982,310.33500000000004,263.83789999999988,9,false],["Strange as it may seem, this is the first verse of",146.40000000000001,277.42789999999991,321.94500000000005,289.8298999999999,9,false],["scripture I ever memorized. I mean I didn’t put it on a",146.40000000000001,290.42389999999989,348.28800000000018,302.82589999999988,9,false],["3 by 5 card or anything, I just thought it was amusing",146.40000000000001,303.41989999999987,345.1110000000001,315.82189999999986,9,false],["that this verse would find its way into the Bible and it",146.40000000000001,316.41589999999985,346.52400000000011,328.81789999999984,9,false],["stuck in my head.",146.40000000000001,329.41189999999983,212.20800000000003,341.81389999999982,9,false],["Funny, I haven’t found much use for it in ministry over",146.40000000000001,355.41289999999981,352.2120000000001,367.8148999999998,9,false],["the years. Seldom have I been in a situation where a",146.40000000000001,368.40889999999979,340.8180000000001,380.81089999999978,9,false],["rebuke of cross-dressing was called for. But should the",146.40000000000001,381.40489999999977,351.55500000000006,393.80689999999976,9,false],["occasion arise, rest assured, I’m prepared.",146.40000000000001,394.40089999999975,304.72800000000007,406.80289999999974,9,false],["I’m the type of person who remembers ideas and",146.40000000000001,420.40189999999973,329.37000000000012,432.80389999999971,9,false],["concepts. I have never been drawn to the practice",146.40000000000001,433.39789999999971,332.75400000000013,445.7998999999997,9,false],["of Bible memorization because generally speaking,",146.40000000000001,446.39389999999969,338.23500000000001,458.79589999999968,9,false],["I generally know what the passage generally says",146.40000000000001,459.38989999999967,330.53100000000006,471.79189999999966,9,false],["and where to find it in the Bible if I need to, at least",146.40000000000001,472.38589999999965,337.13700000000011,484.78789999999964,9,false],["generally.",146.40000000000001,485.38189999999963,183.02100000000002,497.78389999999962,9,false],["But in a variety of recently tempting circumstances,",146.40000000000001,511.38289999999961,342.59100000000001,523.78489999999965,9,false],["I have begun to rethink my earlier arrogance. There",146.40000000000001,524.37889999999959,340.8900000000001,536.78089999999952,9,false],["are times when the gist of a passage is not enough.",146.40000000000001,537.37489999999957,335.09400000000005,549.77689999999961,9,false],["Reread this account of the temptation of Jesus in the",146.40000000000001,550.37089999999966,346.10100000000011,562.77289999999959,9,false],["wilderness:",146.40000000000001,563.36689999999953,190.29300000000001,575.76889999999958,9,false],["Then Jesus was led by the Spirit into the desert to be",146.40000000000001,589.36789999999962,338.5139999999999,601.77889999999957,9,false],["tempted by the devil. After fasting forty days and forty",146.40000000000001,602.3638999999996,347.33399999999995,614.77489999999966,9,false],["nights, he was hungry. The tempter came to him and",146.40000000000001,615.35989999999958,339.73799999999994,627.77089999999964,9,false],["said, “If you are the Son of God, tell these stones to",146.40000000000001,628.35589999999956,330.26100000000002,640.76689999999962,9,false],["become bread.” Jesus answered, “It is written: ‘Man",146.40000000000001,641.35189999999966,335.76900000000001,653.7628999999996,9,false],["does not live on bread alone, but on every word that",146.40000000000001,654.34789999999964,333.83399999999995,666.75889999999958,9,false],["comes from the mouth of God’” (Matthew 4:1-4).",146.40000000000001,667.34389999999962,325.01400000000007,679.75489999999968,9,false],["I think it’s safe to assume that Jesus knew the gist of",146.40000000000001,693.3448999999996,343.70700000000011,705.74689999999964,9,false],["scripture. Yet He quotes God’s Word itself to dispense",146.40000000000001,706.34089999999969,349.548,718.74289999999962,9,false],["with the temptation. While certainly a good reason",370.20299999999997,225.34489999999948,562.47000000000003,237.74689999999953,9,false],["in itself for memorizing scripture, I have found the",370.20299999999997,238.34089999999946,561.51599999999996,250.74289999999951,9,false],["exercise to go far beyond temptation in scope.",370.20299999999997,251.33689999999945,542.67900000000009,263.73889999999949,9,false],["God’s Word provides a jumping off point for praise and",370.20299999999997,277.33789999999954,575.99700000000018,289.73989999999952,9,false],["worship, which the gist of passages doesn’t seem to do.",370.20299999999997,290.33389999999952,575.77200000000005,302.7358999999995,9,false],["The memorized Word renews the mind, leading to a",370.20299999999997,303.3298999999995,565.80000000000007,315.73189999999948,9,false],["transformed life. In Romans 12:2, Paul says not to be",370.20299999999997,316.32589999999948,567.87900000000013,328.72789999999947,9,false],["conformed to this world, but instead to be transformed.",370.20299999999997,329.32189999999946,579.255,341.72389999999945,9,false],["How? By renewing your mind and seeing life from",370.20299999999997,342.31789999999944,559.01400000000001,354.71989999999943,9,false],["God’s perspective (truth) not the world’s perspective",370.20299999999997,355.31389999999942,569.40900000000011,367.71589999999941,9,false],["(lies).",370.20299999999997,368.3098999999994,392.37,380.71189999999939,9,false],["HOW TO MEMORIZE SCRIPTURE",370.20000000000005,400.81989999999996,505.08000000000004,421.35989999999998,20,false],["There are alot of memory systems out there and I’m",370.20000000000005,420.43489999999997,565.35600000000011,432.83689999999996,9,false],["sure there is merit in all of them. It isn’t so much the",370.20000000000005,433.43089999999995,567.19200000000012,445.83289999999994,9,false],["system you use as it is staying with the program. That",370.20000000000005,446.42689999999993,571.94400000000019,458.82889999999992,9,false],["said, here is a very basic plan for how to memorize",370.20000000000005,459.42289999999991,559.62299999999993,471.8248999999999,9,false],["Scripture.",370.20000000000005,471.8248999999999,408.75600000000003,484.22689999999989,9,false],["Read the verse through several times",388.20000000000005,498.41989999999987,527.80800000000011,510.82189999999986,9,false],["thoughtfully aloud.",388.20000000000005,511.41589999999985,460.54200000000003,523.81789999999978,9,false],["Using natural phrases, learn the topic, reference,",388.20000000000005,537.41689999999983,572.13300000000004,549.81889999999987,9,false],["first phrase and so on…",388.20000000000005,550.41289999999981,474.42000000000002,562.81489999999985,9,false],["Write out the verse as part of the learning",388.20000000000005,576.41389999999978,545.01600000000008,588.81589999999983,9,false],["process.",388.20000000000005,589.40989999999988,419.34000000000003,601.81189999999992,9,false],["Review the verses frequently throughout the",388.20000000000005,615.41089999999986,557.04000000000008,627.8128999999999,9,false],["week. A good goal is 2–3 verses per week.",388.20000000000005,628.40689999999995,544.44900000000007,640.80889999999988,9,false],["Review the verse you memorized once a day for",388.20000000000005,654.40789999999993,566.99400000000014,666.80989999999986,9,false],["seven weeks. Then continue to review that verse",388.20000000000005,667.40389999999991,572.75400000000013,679.80589999999984,9,false],["once a week for seven months.",388.20000000000005,680.39989999999989,502.89600000000007,692.80189999999993,9,false],["That may seem like a lot to keep track of, but if you",370.20000000000005,706.40089999999987,560.58600000000013,718.80289999999991,9,false]],"w":612,"h":792,"ocr":false},{"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["use the attached Tracking Sheet it’s pretty simple,",146.40000000000001,33.101899999999887,341.76300000000003,46.484899999999925,9,false],["especially if you make Scripture memory review a",146.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,335.05800000000011,58.832899999999881,9,false],["regular part of your daily Quiet Time.",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,287.39400000000006,71.828899999999862,9,false],["WHAT TO MEMORIZE",146.40000000000001,91.819899999999961,234.54000000000002,112.35989999999993,20,false],["Well, for starters, memorize verses that you find",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,327.84900000000005,123.8368999999999,9,false],["especially meaningful. Then you might want to think",146.40000000000001,124.43089999999984,346.03800000000012,136.83289999999988,9,false],["about memorizing verses in some of the following",146.40000000000001,137.42689999999982,334.32900000000006,149.82889999999986,9,false],["categories, so as to be equipped with the Word of God",146.40000000000001,150.4228999999998,347.2890000000001,162.82489999999984,9,false],["for any and every good work the Lord may call you to.",146.40000000000001,163.41889999999978,346.22700000000009,175.82089999999982,9,false],["SC R I P T U R E",43.841200000000001,560.21789999999999,57.071200000000005,601.39189999999996,7,false],["M E M O RY 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,557.24289999999996,9,false],["The Tracking Sheet is found on the following page . . .",370.20299999999997,657.41989999999987,570.28200000000004,669.82189999999991,9,false]]},{"h":792,"w":612,"segs":[["Topic & Verse",90,43.1644399999999,155.80944,53.277079999999955,11.040000000000001,false],["Once a Day for Seven Weeks",161.94657599999999,43.1644399999999,292.04193600000008,53.277079999999955,11.040000000000001,false],["__________",90,67.611719999999991,145.21624800000001,76.824719999999957,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,90.652079999999955,145.21624800000001,99.865079999999921,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,112.25002000000006,145.21624800000001,121.46302000000003,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,133.85002000000009,145.21624800000001,143.06302000000005,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,155.45001999999999,145.21624800000001,164.66301999999996,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,177.05002000000002,145.21624800000001,186.26301999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,198.53002000000004,145.21624800000001,207.74302,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,220.13002000000006,145.21624800000001,229.34302000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,241.73002000000008,145.21624800000001,250.94302000000005,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,263.33001999999999,145.21624800000001,272.54301999999996,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,284.93001999999996,145.21624800000001,294.14301999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,306.53001999999992,145.21624800000001,315.74301999999994,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,328.01001999999994,145.21624800000001,337.22301999999996,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,349.61001999999996,145.21624800000001,358.82301999999999,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,371.21001999999993,145.21624800000001,380.42301999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["__________",90,392.81001999999995,145.21624800000001,402.02301999999997,9.960000000000000